    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../../aop/interceptor/AsyncUncaughtExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.interceptor\"><code>AsyncUncaughtExceptionHandler</code></a> instance to be used\nwhen an exception is thrown during an asynchronous method execution\nwith <code>void</code> return type.",
      "translation": "用于在具有<code>void</code>返回类型的异步方法执行期间抛出异常时使用的<a href=\"../../aop/interceptor/AsyncUncaughtExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.interceptor\"><code>AsyncUncaughtExceptionHandler</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically implemented by @<a href=\"../../context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Configuration</code></a> classes annotated with @<a href=\"EnableAsync.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>EnableAsync</code></a>.\nSee the @<a href=\"EnableAsync.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>EnableAsync</code></a> javadoc for usage examples.",
      "translation": "通常由带有@<a href=\"EnableAsync.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>EnableAsync</code></a> 注解的@<a href=\"../../context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>Configuration</code></a>类实现。有关使用示例，请参阅@<a href=\"EnableAsync.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>EnableAsync</code></a>的 Javadoc。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>NOTE: An <code>AsyncConfigurer</code> will get initialized early.</b>\nDo not inject common dependencies into autowired fields directly; instead, consider\ndeclaring a lazy <a href=\"../../beans/factory/ObjectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ObjectProvider</code></a> for those.",
      "translation": "<b>注意：<code>AsyncConfigurer</code> 会较早初始化。</b>\n不要直接将公共依赖注入到自动装配字段中；相反，考虑为这些依赖声明一个懒加载的<a href=\"../../beans/factory/ObjectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>ObjectProvider</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a> instance to be used when processing async\nmethod invocations.",
      "translation": "用于处理异步方法调用时使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a> 实例。",
